963 13.9619C14.8593 13.9895 14.4624 13.9935 13.9951 13.9951C13.9935 14.4624 13.9895 14.8593 13.9619 15.1963C13.9292 15.597 13.864 15.9576 13.7197 16.2939L13.6533 16.4365C13.3878 16.9576 12.9841 17.3941 12.4883 17.6982L12.2705 17.8203C11.8937 18.0123 11.4873 18.0915 11.0293 18.1289C10.5791 18.1657 10.022 18.165 9.33301 18.165H6.5C5.81091 18.165 5.25395 18.1657 4.80371 18.1289C4.40306 18.0962 4.04235 18.031 3.70606 17.8867L3.56348 17.8203C3.04244 17.5548 2.60585 17.151 2.30176 16.6553L2.17969 16.4365C1.98788 16.0599 1.90851 15.6541 1.87109 15.1963C1.83431 14.746 1.83496 14.1891 1.83496 13.5V10.667C1.83496 9.978 1.83432 9.42091 1.87109 8.9707C1.90851 8.5127 1.98772 8.10625 2.17969 7.72949L2.30176 7.51172C2.60586 7.0159 3.04236 6.6122 3.56348 6.34668L3.70606 6.28027C4.04237 6.136 4.40303 6.07083 4.80371 6.03809C5.14051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z\"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>\n<hr data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1055\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1067\">🚀 怎么用？</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1076\">使用非常简单：</p>\n<ol data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1179\">\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1179\">打开网站 👉 <a data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1177\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"\" href=\"https://storyviewer.ai/tiktok-story-viewer\">https://storyviewer.ai/tiktok-story-viewer</a></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1221\">\n<p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1221\">粘贴 TikTok 用户名（如 @charlidamelio）或主页链接</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1248\">等几秒加载，就能看到对方主页视频了，点击可播放</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1268\">无需注册，也没有广告，体验感还不错。</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1287\">🧪 我的使用体验</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1343\">我自己是做产品和内容运营的，经常需要看看竞品账号的内容更新情况，有时候还想看看某个话题下有哪些账号在发内容。</p>\n<p data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1393\">以前每次都得开小号、切 VPN，有时候还登录失败。用了这个工具之后，感觉轻松了不少，效率高很多。</p>\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1424\">而且听说后续会加数据导出、互动用户分析等功能，就更期待了。</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1429\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1438\">✅ 总结</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1488\"><strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1458\">StoryViewer.ai</strong> 是一个简单但非常实用的 TikTok 辅助工具，尤其适合：</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1552\">\n<li data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1508\">\n<p data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1508\">想匿名查看他人主页和视频的人</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1530\">\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1530\">做 TikTok 运营/分析的团队</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1552\">\n<p data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1552\">需要快速抓取或研究内容的自由职业者</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1570\">目前是免费使用，感兴趣可以试试：</p>\n<p data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1663\">👉 <a data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1663\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"\" href=\"https://storyviewer.ai/tiktok-story-viewer\">https://storyviewer.ai/tiktok-story-viewer</a></p>\n<!--EndFragment-->\n</body>\n</html>",
